{"nodes": [{"id": "brain_log_71_headline_metric_flip_result_headline_metric_flip", "label": "71 \u2014 flipping the headline metric from MASE to RMSSE", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "brain/log/71_headline_metric_flip_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "No model was re-run and no set recomputed: both losses have been computed and stored on every fold since the first MCS run, so the change is one of designation applied to artefacts already on disk."}, {"id": "brain_log_71_headline_metric_flip_result_declared_deviation", "label": "A declared post-hoc deviation from pre-registration", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/71_headline_metric_flip_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bounded by three facts: the argument is from the estimand and does not depend on which way any result came out, both losses were reported from the first run, and no served decision changes. The artefact now carries headline_designation_changed_post_hoc so the claim does not rely on prose."}, {"id": "brain_log_71_headline_metric_flip_result_mcs_report_key_rename", "label": "eval/mcs_report.py \u2014 loss-named, designation-free keys", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/71_headline_metric_flip_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "mcs_primary_mase / mcs_secondary_rmsse baked a designation into a key a later decision can falsify \u2014 the same defect class as the hard-coded basis literal of report 70."}, {"id": "brain_log_71_headline_metric_flip_result_served_is_argmin_nowhere", "label": "Under RMSSE the served model is the argument-minimum at no venue", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/71_headline_metric_flip_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The chapter's sentence naming Ellel as 'the one venue where the argument-minimum sits away from the served model' is false at all three venues under the new headline."}, {"id": "brain_log_71_headline_metric_flip_result_alpha_025_check", "label": "The alpha=0.25 check, and it flips", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/71_headline_metric_flip_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The elimination is specific, not general: the same rung is retained at alpha=0.25 under the secondary absolute-error loss, so what removes it is the squared measure at the stricter level, not the stricter level alone."}, {"id": "brain_log_71_headline_metric_flip_result_trt_pairwise_gap_3_27_se", "label": "Two River Taps: a 3.27-se pairwise gap absorbed by multiplicity control", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/71_headline_metric_flip_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A gap clear pairwise and absorbed by the confidence set is exactly the situation the MCS exists to arbitrate; the pre-registered rule resolves it toward the incumbent."}, {"id": "brain_log_71_headline_metric_flip_result_trt_frozen_no_operational_cost", "label": "Two River Taps is frozen, so no operational cost attaches", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "brain/log/71_headline_metric_flip_result.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Inferential restraint under a pre-registered rule is not a judgement that a 3.27-se gap would not matter to somebody running the venue; conflating the two is the error the paragraph exists to prevent."}], "edges": [{"source": "brain_log_71_headline_metric_flip_result_headline_metric_flip", "target": "brain_log_63_r4_metr